# Observations from PTBB, clocked by UTC(PTB).  Diagnostic stream: running our
# PPP against a national-timescale-clocked station takes the receiver clock out
# of the error budget.  See docs/known-good-obs-validation.md.
#
# Shell-sourced by str2str-relay-exec (NOT a systemd EnvironmentFile), so
# ARGS must be QUOTED and $HOME expands.  '%Y%m%d_%h' is str2str's filename
# template and passes through untouched -- single %, no systemd escaping.
IN=ntrip://igs-ip.net:2101/PTBB00DEU0
CRED=IGS
ARGS="-out ntripc://:2102/PTBB -out file://$HOME/opt/ntrip-relay/logs/ptbb_%Y%m%d_%h.rtcm3::T::S=24 -r 30000"

